# Dedicated build context; overrides the root build/ exclusion.
**
!build/
!build/upstream/
!build/upstream/paperclip/
!build/upstream/paperclip/**
build/upstream/paperclip/**/.git
build/upstream/paperclip/**/.git/**
build/upstream/paperclip/**/.env
build/upstream/paperclip/**/.env.*
!build/upstream/paperclip/**/.env.example
build/upstream/paperclip/**/.ssh/**
build/upstream/paperclip/secrets/**
build/upstream/paperclip/**/node_modules/**
build/upstream/paperclip/**/.venv/**
build/upstream/paperclip/**/__pycache__/**
